 "title": "Dual 2-input NAND gate, 74AHC and 74AHCT",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev. 6, 31 August 2023",
  "pages": 11
 },
 "summary": "Two independent 2-input NAND gates in one 8-lead package, built in high-speed silicon-gate CMOS. The 74AHC2G00 has CMOS input thresholds and runs from 2.0 V to 5.5 V; the 74AHCT2G00 has TTL input thresholds and runs from 4.5 V to 5.5 V. Outputs have balanced drive and delays, and inputs accept up to 5.5 V whatever the supply. 74AHC2G00DC,125 is the CMOS-threshold part in the VSSOP8 (SOT765-1) package.",
 "key_figures": [
  [
   "Supply voltage",
   "2.0 V to 5.5 V (74AHC2G00); 4.5 V to 5.5 V (74AHCT2G00)"
  ],
  [
   "Propagation delay tpd",
   "4.9 ns typ, 7.5 ns max at VCC = 4.5 V to 5.5 V, CL = 50 pF, 25 °C (74AHC2G00)"
  ],
  [
   "Output current",
   "±8.0 mA at VCC = 4.5 V (VOH/VOL specified); ±25 mA absolute maximum"
  ],
